@startuml SD3
!include style.iuml
autonumber
actor "Enrolment\nOfficer" as O
participant "Issuer\nService" as I
participant "Trust &\nRevocation" as T
participant "Verifier\nApp" as V
database "Local cache" as C
participant "Audit &\nSync" as AU

== Revocation (office, online) ==
O -> I : revoke credential (reason)
I -> I : sign full revocation list v+1\n(issuer key never leaves Issuer)
I -> T : PUT signed list + service key
T -> T : verify signature, refuse rollback
T --> I : ack

== Later: distribution point regains signal ==
V ->> T : GET /keys
V ->> T : GET /revocations?since={cached version}
T -->> V : signed key set + revocation delta
V -> V : verify list signature
V -> C : replace cached keys and list, record fetch time
V -> C : read queued verification records
V ->> AU : POST /records (batch) + agent JWT
AU -> AU : append each record to hash chain\n(hash = SHA-256(record + previous hash))
AU -->> V : ack (last accepted record ID)
V -> C : clear acknowledged records
note right of V : Open arrows = asynchronous messages.\nIf no signal, the verifier keeps working\nfrom the cache and retries later.
@enduml
